From nxnative (seedds/nxnative, MIT) 9507c221: guarded Ampere deferred writes (variable-latency results).
A guarded instruction that ends a block must not jump to the next block over pending commits, and a guarded deferred write
commits only if its guard held at issue. Without this OoT glyph quads lost attribute y (zero height: invisible text).
